## Gating

An entry is proven when it has a passing good case, a passing invalid case
(not required of Intermediate entries), no failing case, and every one of
its hosts answered in a passing case. An unproven entry, or the patterns of
its unreached hosts, leaves DefaultRegistry (see
unshorten/testdata/livenet/README.md).

